WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two people make room for a daily breathing routine.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers match the audio but change the breathing pace.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Four weeks later, both groups report feeling better.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The slower protocol does not outperform the matched practice on the primary stress measure.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The feeling may be real. The reason still needs a fair comparison.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before buying audio, check the research, the offer and the limits.
